<title>USA: R.G. Barry to expand in Britian, Europe.</title>
<headline>R.G. Barry to expand in Britian, Europe.</headline>
<dateline>PICKERINGTON, Ohio 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>R.G. Barry Corp said Wednesday it has established a new division called Barry/Europe to support expansion in Britian and Europe.</p>
<p>The footware maker said the new unit will begin operations in the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>The unit will help Barry expand sales to mass-market retail outlets, the company said.</p>
